BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:PyData Helsinki: Meetup at Visma
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/Helsinki:20260812T173000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/Helsinki:20260812T203000
DTSTAMP:20260806T171420Z
UID:2026-08-12-visma@pydata-helsinki.github.io
DESCRIPTION:An evening of talks at Visma: custom LLM benchmarks\, survival
  models\, and Kalman filters — plus snacks\, drinks\, networking\, and t
 he (in)famous PyData Helsinki quiz.\nPlease be on time! Latecomers may be 
 unable to get in\, since Visma personnel need to be there to let you in th
 rough locked doors.\n\nProgramme:\n- Allan Nevala: Mistral LLM - Custom Be
 nchmarks\n- Babäk Firoozi Fooladi: What is a survival model?\n- Anna Koro
 lyuk: Implementing Kalman filter in Python - from linear to non linear\n\n
 Details: https://pydata-helsinki.github.io/events/2026-08-12-visma/\nRegis
 ter: https://www.meetup.com/pydatahelsinki/events/315105052/
GEO:60.19852;24.931107
LOCATION:Visma\, Mall of Tripla\, Workery East D
ORGANIZER;CN="PyData Helsinki":https://pydata-helsinki.github.io/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://pydata-helsinki.github.io/events/2026-08-12-visma/
END:VEVENT
